        "entry_version_id": "mem_ver_c3e24800a4e748fd89983f55a7ba27ff"
      },
      "version": 1,
      "kind": "favor",
      "text": "客人拎来三坛桂花酿，把上次摔碗的账认了。（原话：上次的事是我不对，我赔你三坛酒。）",
      "state": "active",
      "source_refs": [],
      "artifact_refs": []
    },
    {
      "citation": {
        "memory_ref": {
          "family": "memory",
          "artifact_id": "memory",
          "revision": 10
        },
        "entry_id": "mem_ent_5d27ac5ce9b74c9f97026ba1adf00b21",
        "entry_version_id": "mem_ver_aade5c0e03ba43cf905d5251b39f4897"
      },
      "version": 1,
      "kind": "neutral",
      "text": "客人打听客栈开了多少年，问起掌柜的旧事。（原话：掌柜的，你这客栈开多少年了？可有旧相好？）",
      "state": "active",
      "source_refs": [],
      "artifact_refs": []
    },
    {
      "citation": {
        "memory_ref": {
          "family": "memory",
          "artifact_id": "memory",
          "revision": 10
        },
        "entry_id": "mem_ent_bde8a176a93d4698b0f9f86bf4cc5006",
        "entry_version_id": "mem_ver_f24e389417a242488cc34e68e2ab85c5"
      },
      "version": 1,
      "kind": "offense",
      "text": "客人摔碎了柜台上一只青瓷碗，还赖着不赔。（原话：我把你柜上的青瓷碗摔了，一文不赔）",
      "state": "active",
      "source_refs": [],
      "artifact_refs": []
    },
    {
      "citation": {
        "memory_ref": {
          "family": "memory",
          "artifact_id": "memory",
          "revision": 10
        },
        "entry_id": "mem_ent_c3878a7bd17b4f7cb0f755ecd1a56567",
        "entry_version_id": "mem_ver_6ad3fd3c50bc4a36baf50e00f2439106"
      },
      "version": 1,
      "kind": "offense",
      "text": "客人摔碎了柜台上一只青瓷碗，还赖着不赔。（原话：我又来了，上次的碗钱……）",
      "state": "active",
